    "arm_a": "Arm A: in a name where insiders have sold heavily (at least 10 sales for every buy across the record) while options trading is at its hottest, the name will trail SPY by an average of at least 1.5 points over the next 21 trading days.",
    "arm_b": "Arm B: in a name where an insider buy is on record while options trading is cold, the name will beat SPY by an average of at least 1.0 point over the next 21 trading days.",
